  LP_ind(l): l1=0.70680  l2=0.55051  l3=0.43571  l4=0.41616  l5=0.41616  l6=0.41616
  sym strictly improves R->R+1: [True, True, True, True, True]
  ind strictly improves l->l+1: [True, True, True, False, False]
  level l where LP_ind PINS consec (==measS7): 4
  level R where LP_sym PINS consec (==measS7): 6

--- k=10 consec, measS7=0.504478 ---
  LP_sym(R): R1=0.80115  R2=0.63074  R3=0.57008  R4=0.52857  R5=0.50859  R6=0.50448
